    Note the NonCommercial term: this data may not be used commercially, whatever
    the MIT licence permits for the surrounding code.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
INTERGROWTH-21st Newborn Size Standards
    app/src/main/resources/ig21/*.json

    Skew-t parameters (mu, sigma, nu, tau) for birth weight, length and head
    circumference from 33+0 to 42+6 weeks, from the project's published
    parameter workbooks.

    Villar J, et al. International standards for newborn weight, length, and head
    circumference by gestational age and sex: the Newborn Cross-Sectional Study of
    the INTERGROWTH-21st Project. Lancet 2014;384(9946):857-68.
    https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(14)60932-6
    https://intergrowth21.com/tools-resources/newborn-size

    The project's site does not state explicit licence terms for these files;
    confirm them with the publisher before any use beyond personal record-keeping.

